SF0058 Elimination of sales tax on firearms.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Olsen, Crago, Driskill, Landen and
Nethercott and Representative(s) Geringer, Larson,
JT, Lawley and Wylie
AN ACT relating to sales and use tax; providing an exemption from sales and use
tax for firearms, ammunition and archery equipment; providing applicability;
and providing for an effective date.
